---
import './Hero.css';
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__text">
    <span class="hero__eyebrow">Belleza que te ilumina</span>
    <h1>Encuentra tu tono ideal</h1>
    <p>
      Explora el catálogo y filtra por tono, categoría o precio para encontrar exactamente lo que buscas, con toda
      la gama de tonos de piel representada de verdad.
    </p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#catalogo">Explorar catálogo</a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero__art" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 320 260" class="hero__svg">
      <ellipse cx="200" cy="180" rx="120" ry="70" fill="var(--color-secondary)" opacity=".35"></ellipse>
      <circle cx="120" cy="95" r="70" fill="#F3DED4"></circle>
      <path d="M75 95c0-30 24-52 52-52M172 95c0 30-24 52-52 52" stroke="var(--color-primary)" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"></path>
      <circle cx="95" cy="55" r="4" fill="var(--color-accent)"></circle>
      <circle cx="108" cy="47" r="2" fill="var(--color-accent)"></circle>
      <rect x="185" y="130" width="34" height="70" rx="14" fill="var(--color-accent)"></rect>
      <rect x="192" y="118" width="20" height="20" rx="6" fill="var(--color-primary)"></rect>
      <circle cx="245" cy="150" r="22" fill="var(--color-primary)"></circle>
      <circle cx="245" cy="150" r="10" fill="var(--color-bg)"></circle>
    </svg>
  </div>
</section>
